+      "features/todo-management.feature:Main and footer are shown when there are todos",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Completing a todo toggles its completed state",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Deleting a todo removes it",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Toggle-all marks every todo as complete",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Clear completed removes only the completed todos",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Double-clicking a todo activates editing mode",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Saving an edit on Enter updates the todo title",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Saving an edit on blur updates the todo title",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Empty edit destroys the todo",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:Escape during editing discards the changes",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:The todo count shows the number of active items with pluralized text",
+      "features/todo-management.feature:The todo count shows singular text for 1 active item",
+      "features/todo-filtering.feature:The default route is All",
+      "features/todo-filtering.feature:The All route shows all todos",
+      "features/todo-filtering.feature:The Active route shows only active todos",
+      "features/todo-filtering.feature:The Completed route shows only completed todos",
+      "features/todo-filtering.feature:Item updated while filtered is hidden correctly",
+      "features/todo-filtering.feature:Switching back to All from a filtered view restores all items",
+      "features/todo-persistence.feature:Todos are saved to localStorage with the correct key and format",
